==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~23.33 seconds<sup>300f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A stage somewhat similar to [[Hungry Forest]]. If you have beaten Hungry Forest before, than you should most likely just copy your slot and change some things around if you may need to. If you have not beaten Hungry Forest before, then use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], along with other attackers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and some [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]].

